NOTE ON MINECRAFT ASSETS / 关于 Minecraft 素材

The MIT license above covers this project's own source code only.

LiteVault contains and distributes NO Minecraft assets. Block textures, block
models and translation strings are extracted at runtime, on the user's own
machine, from a Minecraft client jar the user already has installed, and are
stored only in that machine's local application data directory. Those assets
remain the property of Mojang Studios / Microsoft and are governed by the
Minecraft End User License Agreement — not by this license.

以上 MIT 许可只覆盖本项目自己的源代码。

LiteVault 不包含、也不分发任何 Minecraft 素材。方块贴图、模型和译名是在用户
本机、从用户自己已安装的 Minecraft 客户端 jar 中提取的，只保存在本机的应用数据
目录里。这些素材的权利归 Mojang Studios / Microsoft，适用 Minecraft 最终用户
许可协议，不适用本许可证。

LiteVault is not an official Minecraft product. It is not approved by or
associated with Mojang Studios or Microsoft.
